p we're going to have a good  minor piece and black is going to have a  bad minor piece or now it's going to be  able to roam all over the board and the  bishops basically going to be worthless  so yes we do have the same amount of  material but we have much better pieces  than black discs so this is going to be  a better game for white the advantage is  not huge but at the same time it is  advantage and anytime you can get an  advantage in chess it's usually good  take  so this is one of the few things that  you can take in your chest learning  anytime in the middle game you always  want to take a look at if it's an open  game or a close game and this is really  going to determine how you look at your  minor pieces people always ask me what's  something I should look at in my game  you know I understand the openings but  once I get to the middle game well  there's a lot of different things as far  as tactics and strategy but one of the  main things you want to know is is it an  open game or a close game and act  accordingly so hope you guys enjoy this  video if you haven't already please  subscribe and I'll see you guys in the  next video thanks for watching
 

